{
  "scope": "Review of pinned external source before inference; local measurements are separate. No external weights or source code are vendored.",
  "architectural_findings": [
    "Single-token candidate codes and a separate 255-row projection at the last prompt position.",
    "Full-attention layers use a noncausal mask; Gated DeltaNet recurrence remains causal.",
    "Each question has its own prompt; batch size one and no permutation averaging in this comparison.",
    "D3 confidence is one minus normalized entropy, distinct from selected-option probability and learned correctness.",
    "The accelerated path requires ROCm; NVIDIA uses standard PyTorch CUDA.",
    "Training exposure and LoRA/full-weight training details are not established by the inspected inference package."
